   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "new": {
      "kind": "margin",
      "french": "Dessin 3 octobre 1877\nPeinture 30 septembre 1878\nMédaille 14 janvier 1879\nPeinture 30 septembre 1878\npréd. d'Edmond, livre 75\npage 139, livre 89, arrangement sage",
      "rsr": "Marie's notes on the flyleaf before the Livre 90 title page, in small type; tome14.docx ¶44–49, Mon Journal t.14 p.5 (scan checked). Her art milestones (drawing from 3 Oct 1877, when she began at the Académie Julian; painting from 30 Sept 1878; the medal of 14 Jan 1879) and pointers to earlier notebooks (Edmond's prediction in Livre 75; a sensible arrangement on p.139 of Livre 89). The same list, with other printed dates, is on the Livre 89 title page (089.0002: «Prédiction d'Edmond (livre 75…», «Résolution sage»). The «Peinture 30 septembre 1878» line is printed twice and kept twice. Typesetting typos corrected (owner policy): printed «septbembre» → «septembre», «arrangemement» → «arrangement». «préd.» is Marie's abbreviation of «prédiction» (spelled out on the Livre 89 title page); keep it abbreviated. Restored in the 2026-09-29 title-notes pass (owner policy: Marie's own title-page notes go in; formal title lines stay withdrawn).",
      "source": "note de Marie sur la page de garde du Livre 90"
     }
    },
    {
     "new": {
      "kind": "margin",
      "french": "Ceux que je choque et qui ne veulent pas de moi ne sont pas de l'espèce de ceux dont je voudrais.",
      "rsr": "Maxim on the same flyleaf before the Livre 90 title page, small type; tome14.docx ¶50, Mon Journal t.14 p.5 (scan checked). Restored in the 2026-09-29 title-notes pass (owner policy: Marie's own title-page notes go in; formal title lines stay withdrawn).",
      "source": "note de Marie sur la page de garde du Livre 90"
     }
